sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Klien<br/>Flutter/HarmonyOS/Web
    participant Nginx as Nginx :80/:443
    participant Security as Security<br/>Middleware
    participant Pipeline as Pipa Middleware<br/>10 Global MW
    participant RateLimit as RateLimit<br/>Middleware
    participant Route as Distribusi Rute
    participant Poster as PosterVerify
    participant JWT as JwtAuth
    participant Controller as Controller
    participant Model as Model<br/>BaseModel
    participant MySQL as MySQL 8.0
    participant Redis as Redis 7
    participant ES as ES 8
    participant Response as Response<br/>HashidsEncode

    Client->>Nginx: HTTP Request<br/>api.erik.xyz/api/v1/...
    Nginx->>Security: Meneruskan permintaan

    rect rgb(255, 205, 210)
        Note over Security: Tahap deteksi keamanan
        Security->>Security: ① Validasi Content-Type
        Security->>Security: ② Body Size ≤ 10MB
        Security->>Security: ③ Deteksi XSS 13 aturan
        Security->>Security: ④ Deteksi SQLi 13 aturan
        Security->>Security: ⑤ Injeksi CRLF Header
        Security->>Security: ⑥ Path Traversal
    end

    alt Serangan terdeteksi
        Security-->>Client: Respons kesalahan 4xxxx
    end

    Security->>Pipeline: Keamanan lolos

    rect rgb(227, 242, 253)
        Note over Pipeline: Tahap pra-pemrosesan permintaan
        Pipeline->>Pipeline: ⑦ Pengaturan header respons Cors
        Pipeline->>Pipeline: ⑧ Identifikasi sumber Platform
        Pipeline->>Pipeline: ⑨ GeoIp wilayah/mata uang
        Pipeline->>Pipeline: ⑩ Pengaturan bahasa Locale
        Pipeline->>Pipeline: ⑪ HashidsDecode dekode ID
        Pipeline->>Pipeline: ⑫ VersionRoute versi API
    end

    Pipeline->>RateLimit: Pemeriksaan rate limit

    rect rgb(255, 249, 196)
        Note over RateLimit: Rate limiting token bucket
        RateLimit->>Redis: ZADD + ZREMRANGEBYSCORE<br/>Penghitungan jendela geser
        Redis-->>RateLimit: Jumlah permintaan jendela saat ini
    end

    alt Melebihi batas
        RateLimit-->>Client: 429 Retry-After
    end

    RateLimit->>Route: Lolos

    Route->>Route: API-Version → namespace<br/>Pencocokan Controller

    alt Operasi sensitif registrasi/pesan/bayar
        Route->>Poster: Verifikasi manusia
        Poster->>Redis: GET poster_token:{key}
        Redis-->>Poster: token
        alt Verifikasi gagal
            Poster-->>Client: 40007 Verifikasi gagal
        end
    end

    alt Antarmuka perlu autentikasi
        Route->>JWT: Bearer Token
        JWT->>JWT: Verifikasi tanda tangan HS256 + pemeriksaan kedaluwarsa
        alt Token tidak valid
            JWT-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized
        end
        JWT->>Controller: request→userId
    end

    Route->>Controller: Pemrosesan bisnis

    rect rgb(200, 230, 201)
        Note over Controller,ES: Pemrosesan logika bisnis
        Controller->>Model: Memanggil Model
        Model->>Model: Pembuatan Snowflake ID
        Model->>Model: Enkripsi/dekripsi Encryptable
        Model->>MySQL: Operasi baca/tulis
        MySQL-->>Model: Hasil
        Model->>ES: Pencarian/indeks
        ES-->>Model: Hasil pencarian
        Model-->>Controller: Data bisnis
    end

    Controller->>Response: Mengembalikan data

    rect rgb(187, 222, 251)
        Note over Response: Pemrosesan pasca-respons
        Response->>Response: HashidsEncode enkripsi ID
        Response->>Response: Enkripsi AES field sensitif
        Response->>Response: JSON {code, msg, data}
    end

    Response->>Nginx: HTTP Response
    Nginx->>Client: JSON + CORS Headers
